<html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Analisis DDPK Serius</title>
<style>body{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px} h1,h2{margin:4px 0} table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:10px 0} th,td{border:1px solid #000;padding:6px;vertical-align:top} th{background:#d9ead3} .meta{margin-bottom:12px} .small{font-size:11px;color:#333}</style>
